# Bun specific
bun.lockb

# NOTE: prisma/migrations is deliberately NOT ignored. It was excluded here while
# the container's start command runs `prisma migrate deploy`, which exits 0 on an
# empty migrations directory - so the image silently applied nothing for the life
# of the deployment. Excluding it again re-breaks database migration in
# production, without any error to notice.
